<title>ITALY: BCI 1996 CONS NET PROFIT 378 BILLION LIRE.</title>
<headline>BCI 1996 CONS NET PROFIT 378 BILLION LIRE.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's Banca Commerciale Italiana (BCI) on Monday said its 1996 consolidated net profit reached 378 billion lire compared to 365 billion lire and 329 billion lire in the two preceeding years.</p>
</text>
